from My Morning Jacket,

00:35:35.518 --> 00:35:37.740
and we are so grateful to be here with you

00:35:37.740 --> 00:35:41.073
and National Geographic on Earth Day Eve

00:35:42.002 --> 00:35:44.784
as we know now more than ever

00:35:44.784 --> 00:35:49.784
it's so important for us all
to send as much love as we can

00:35:50.006 --> 00:35:51.881
to Mother Earth

00:35:51.881 --> 00:35:55.445
for her continued healing and protection.

00:35:55.445 --> 00:35:57.073
Thank you.

