00:47:56.659 --> 00:47:59.159
reveal an extraordinary truth.

00:48:02.417 --> 00:48:04.084
Whales have culture.

00:48:07.423 --> 00:48:10.256
(beluga chirping)

00:48:11.777 --> 00:48:14.860
Each family speaks a unique language.

00:48:19.667 --> 00:48:21.084
They love deeply,

00:48:29.221 --> 00:48:30.304
play with joy

00:48:37.333 --> 00:48:39.083
and mourn their dead.

00:48:48.073 --> 00:48:50.073
Whales are just like us.

00:48:59.631 --> 00:49:02.460
And one of the smartest
of them all is proving

00:49:02.460 --> 00:49:07.127
that these social bonds are
the secret to their success.

